          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Faires Sekiya is a seasoned cinematographer with over two decades of experience in film and television."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-69",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Known for his expertise in Steadicam operation, he has worked on notable productions such as *Chicago Med*, *Chi-Raq*, and *Boss*."
